		"notes": "\n\t<p><i>Shadow-black, bipedal, eight- eyed spiderfolk. Lurking half- dream.</i></p>\n\t<p></p>\n\t<p><strong>AC</strong> 12, <strong>HP</strong> 14, <strong>ATK</strong> 2 bite +2 (1d6) or 1 poison web (near) +2, <strong>MV</strong> near (climb, fly), <strong>S</strong> +0, <strong>D</strong> +2, <strong>C</strong> +1, <strong>I</strong> -1, <strong>W</strong> +0, <strong>Ch</strong> +0, <strong>AL</strong> <strong>C</strong>, <strong>LV</strong> 3</p><p></p>\n\t<p><strong>Great Evil</strong>. Only damaged by silver or magical sources.</p><p></p><p><strong>Night Terror</strong>. Dreams of targets within far are filled with wretched nightmares. CHA 12+ or 1d4 WIS damage (can't heal or rest while cursed). Repeat check each day, die at 0 WIS.</p><p></p><p><strong>Poison Web</strong>. One target stuck in place and 1d4 damage/round. DEX 12+ on turn to escape.</p><p></p>\n\t<p><i>Shadowfinder Complete Bestiary</i></p>",
